{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  最近よく聴く\n  チャットモンチーさん。\n  \n  絶妙な歌詞とメロディが癖になります。\n  女子は特に好きな世界観ですよね！\n  \n  染まるよ\n  真夜中遊園地\n  恋の煙\n  バスロマンス\n  例えば、\n  \n  \n  が好き\n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF7HMP1ZPW3J1TSAFX7H0P5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  渋谷\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  握手会ブースに祝花！\n  嬉しい ありがとうございます！\n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF7HNQJP49PHE1XZTSRMT72","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF7HPQ9EMPN8V3ZJHXV174G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  前回の自己紹介ブログ\n  どうでしたか？\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF7HQRGDWEBZE4J637E5VCB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  メイクやヘアなど女の子向けブログも\n  今、書いてます〜\n  質問あれば、何でもこちらにどうぞ。\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF7HS458A362Y4H3X4W8ZWW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  このポーズ自分の中で\n  はまってるみたい。笑\n  なんかじわじわ\n  \n  \n  では！\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"}